<title>GERMANY: VW details Q1 1997 sales, production data.</title>
<headline>VW details Q1 1997 sales, production data.</headline>
<dateline>WOLFSBURG, Germany 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First three months of 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group deliveries to customers	  1,033,785 vs 943,211</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    --Domestic				   233,954 vs 245,940</p>
<p>    --Foreign				    799,831 vs 697,271</p>
<p>    Group vehicle sales			1,027,073 vs 980,788</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    --Domestic				   231,170 vs 256,845</p>
<p>    --Foreign				    796,903 vs 723,943</p>
<p>    Group vehicle production		 1,038,439 vs 1,009,475</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    --Domestic				   399,761 vs 421,672</p>
<p>    --Foreign				    638,678 vs 587,803</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    262,817 vs 260,811</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    --Domestic				   138,417 vs 137,769</p>
<p>    --Foreign				    124,400 vs 123,042</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carmaker is Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>The workforce figures compared the end of the first quarter with the end of 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
